This week bogmode.ca changed shape.

- **My own projects up front.** Scales of Existence, Drone Sim, the Multi-Drone Mission Planner and more now sit next to Upstreams, Fiend and DroneWashers.
- **One NDA folder.** Professional case studies now live in a single folder, shared with names and numbers removed.
- **This news feed.** A short update every week on what I'm building, what shipped and what I learned.

Next up: live demos on every project page.
